- `table_name`: `Cstring` (optionally) the table name used to refer to the appended data, defaults to "appended_data".
- `column_names`: `Ref{Cstring}` (optionally) the list of column names, defaults to "col1", "col2", ...
- `out_appender`: `Ref{duckdb_appender}` The resulting appender object.

